#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.rst:2
msgid "qfeval\\_functions.functions.orthogonalize"
msgstr "qfeval\\_functions.functions.orthogonalize"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:1
#, fuzzy
msgid "Orthogonalize tensor x with respect to tensor y."
msgstr "指定された次元に沿って、xをyに対して直交化します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:3
msgid ""
"This function performs the Gram-Schmidt orthogonalization process, "
"removing the component of :attr:`x` that is parallel to :attr:`y` along "
"the specified dimension. The result is a tensor that is orthogonal to "
":attr:`y` while preserving the orthogonal component of :attr:`x`."
msgstr "この関数はグラム・シュミット直交化処理を実行し、指定された次元に沿って :attr:`x` の :attr:`y` と平行な成分を除去します。結果として得られるテンソルは、:attr:`x` の直交成分を保持しつつ、:attr:`y` に対して直交するテンソルとなります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:8
#, fuzzy
msgid "The orthogonalization is computed as:"
msgstr "直交化されたテンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{orthogonalized}(x) = x - \\frac{\\langle x, y \\rangle}{\\langle "
"y, y \\rangle} y\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\\text{orthogonalized}(x) = x - \\frac{\\langle x, y \\rangle}{\\langle y, y \\rangle} y\n\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:13
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\langle \\cdot, \\cdot \\rangle` denotes the dot product "
"along the specified dimension."
msgstr "ここで :math:`\\langle \\cdot, \\cdot \\rangle` は、指定された次元に沿ったドット積を表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:17
msgid "The tensor to be orthogonalized."
msgstr "直交化するテンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:20
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The reference tensor with respect to which :attr:`x` will be "
"orthogonalized. Must have the same shape as :attr:`x`."
msgstr "xを直交化する際に基準となるテンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:24
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The dimension along which the orthogonalization is performed. Default is "
"-1 (the last dimension)."
msgstr "直交化を実行する次元。デフォルト値は -1 です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Returns"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:28
#, fuzzy
msgid "The orthogonalized tensor with the same shape as :attr:`x`."
msgstr "直交化されたテンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:32
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

